WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.840
Shoebox. Keep it.

2
00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.510
It comes back to you.

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.590
Shoebox reads the day it's about, and brings it back before then.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:16.990
Forward the school newsletter. Shoebox finds the dates that are about your family, and makes each one its own post. They come back before the day.

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.510
Flick up for the next one.

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.280
Pull down when you're done.

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.980
Tap to open.

8
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.000
It reads on your phone, with Apple Intelligence.

9
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.000
Shoebox for iPhone. Join the beta.
